  "new_commit_message": "docs(document-api-endpoint): Say @sentry/api releases from getsentry/sentry (#193)\n\n`@sentry/api` now lives in getsentry/sentry's `static/packages/api`\n(getsentry/sentry#130472). When the spec changes on master,\n`openapi.yml` cuts an `api@` release, so getsentry/sentry-api-schema no\nlonger regenerates anything downstream. The skill now says a published\nendpoint reaches the SDK and MCP with that next `api@` release.\n\n<!-- junior-request-attribution:start -->\nvia @BYK.\n<!-- junior-request-attribution:end -->\n\n<!-- junior-session-footer:start -->\n<!-- junior-conversation-id:agent%3A69da19b385017e68b7f9eace56e9477f -->\n\n--\n\n[View\nSession](https://junior-prod.sentry.dev/conversations/agent%3A69da19b385017e68b7f9eace56e9477f)\n[[Sentry]](https://sentry.sentry.io/explore/conversations/agent%3A69da19b385017e68b7f9eace56e9477f/?project=4510944073809921)\n\n<!-- junior-session-footer:end -->",
